! !! {{Errata col|page=Blast The Door, Kid!|label=Original|date=July 1996|ref=<ref name="errata-btd-orig">[[:File:ANH-L-blastthedoorkid-decipher-archive.gif|Original printed face]]. Original printed face: [https://web.archive.org/web/20020418172129/http://www.decipher.com/starwars/cardlists/anewhope/light/small/blastthedoorkid.html Blast The Door, Kid!], [[Decipher]] (archived 18 April 2002). Release month (later collector chronology): [https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2], p. 6, July 1996.</ref>}} !! {{Errata col|page=Blast The Door, Kid! (Errata)|label=Decipher Errata|date=November 1998|ref=<ref name="errata-btd-gl">[[Media:Decipher_Glossary_1998.pdf|Decipher Glossary Version 2.0]] (Blast The Door, Kid!; November 1998). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20061215115652/http://decipher.com:80/starwars/rules/pdf/swccgglossary.pdf Internet Archive]. [[Media:Decipher_Glossary_Supplement.pdf|Glossary Supplement]] (29 January 2002) repeats that replacement text and adds a ruling paragraph (not Card Text). The white-border [[Blast The Door, Kid! (Revised)]] (September 1998) already prints these words.</ref>}} !! {{Errata col|page=Blast The Door, Kid! (PC Errata)|label=PC Errata|date=1 March 2017|ref=<ref name="errata-btd-pc">[https://web.archive.org/web/20170705005900/http://www.starwarsccg.org/virtual/DErrata.pdf Players Committee ''Decipher Errata'' sheet] (“Official text as of March 1, 2017”; PDF created 31 May 2017; Internet Archive copy of 5 July 2017). The 2013 sheet still reprinted the Glossary wording. [[Media:SWCCG_2023_AdvancedRulebook.pdf|SWCCG 2023 Advanced Rulebook]] Appendix A, p. 105 reprints the 2017 replacement (no comma after <code>battle</code>).</ref>}}
