| {{Errata hl|After a battle at an interior site is initiated}}, use 1 Force to {{Errata hl|cause all leaders and all characters with ability > 2 (on both sides) to be completely excluded from that battle}}. || {{Errata hl|If a battle was just initiated at an interior site}}, use 1 Force {{Errata hl|to exclude from that battle all characters of ability > 2 and all leaders (on both sides)}}. || If a battle was just initiated at an interior site, use 1 Force{{Errata hl|; for remainder of battle}} all characters of ability > 2 and all leaders (on both sides) {{Errata hl|are simultaneously excluded from that battle}}.
