== Editing ==
This shared table is the '''Errata''' section on the English [[Blast The Door, Kid!]], [[Blast The Door, Kid! (Errata)]] and [[Blast The Door, Kid! (PC Errata)]] articles. Do not transclude onto Japanese, Revised, Unlimited, Two-Player, foil, or (V) articles. Use '''Edit errata''' on a member page. {{tl|Errata hl}} only the words or values that changed; an em dash if that field is unchanged. See [[SWCCG Wiki:Style guide#Errata comparison table]]. Columns are Original · Decipher Errata · PC Errata.
